Predicted cause: {1}

Approximate game time using current bleeding, natural blood recovery, shock, active tending and its expiry, adrenaline decay, oxygen delivery, brain injury and active failure timers. Future cerebral progression is projected for up to 24 game hours; longer existing failure timers are calculated separately. Current cold, breathing, pumping and dilution are held constant. No future treatments, organ restoration or random complications are assumed. Other diseases, new injuries and native scripted deaths can kill sooner. The forecast never changes the patient's health or doctor priorities.
